<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24668" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διᾰγωγ-ή</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>carrying across,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τριήρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Polyaen.
					5.2.6
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> lit.
				<i>carrying through</i>: hence metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ διὰ πάντων αὐτῶν δ.</span>
			<i>taking a person through</i> a subject by instruction, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				343e
			</span></i>; so, <i>course of instruction, lectures,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τῇ ἐνεστώσῃ δ.</span> prob. in
				<i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Piet.</u>
				25
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>passing of life, way</i> or <i>course of life,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. βίου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					344e
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				177a
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>way of passing time, amusement,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. μετὰ παιδιᾶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>EN</u>
					1127b34
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				1177a27
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ἐλευθέριος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1339b5
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαγωγαὶ τοῦ συζῆν</span> public
				<i>pastimes,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				1280b37
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				126b
			</span></i> (pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>delay,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				57.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>management,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν πραγμάτων δ.</span>
			<i>dispatch</i> of business, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				48.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>station</i> for ships, f. l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdn.
				4.2.8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>V.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαγωγάν: διαίρεσιν, διανομήν, διέλευσιν,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
